## Ticket workflow

- Skills/commands live in `~/.cursor/` (Dotfiles), not in the forum-iOS repo.
- Fetch: `jira get <KEY>`
- Branch: `feature/<KEY>-<kebab-summary>` from the agreed base (default `main`)
- Create: `create-forum-ticket` skill → `jira create` (defaults in `~/.cursor/forum/ticket-preferences.json`)
- Edit: `edit-forum-ticket` skill → `jira edit <KEY>`
